ShopAgent Price Monitor

This repository contains the price-monitoring application extracted from the
maintainer's ShopAgent research project. It is an independent application,
not an official ShopSimulator implementation.

The original prototype and local experiments use product catalog data from
ShopSimulator: https://github.com/ShopAgent-Team/ShopSimulator
We acknowledge the original project's shopping-agent research environment
and data resources. Its original product dataset is not redistributed here;
external data remains subject to its own usage terms, not this project's MIT
license.

The demo product catalog is fictional and authored for this application.
No third-party product dataset, model weights, private experiment reports,
local credentials, user database, or prior Git history is distributed here.

To respect platform data-access authorization and usage requirements, this
release does not integrate with or scrape live e-commerce platforms. Product
search uses local catalogs. Prices come from event-driven simulation,
fixed-scenario replay or locally imported snapshots. Simulated prices are
test data and do not represent live market prices or trends.

Python dependencies retain their own licenses. Provider names describe API
compatibility and do not imply affiliation or endorsement.

The bundled browser application uses Vue and Vue Router. Copyright and
license texts for the bundled frontend dependencies are generated at build
time in shopagent_monitor/app/static/third-party-licenses.md and distributed
with the Python package. Frontend build tools retain their own licenses.
